            {
              "text": "IVF goes from the female’s body, to the dish, and back to the female: hormones to stimulate ovulation (<b>C</b>), harvest the oocytes (<b>G</b>), add sperm (<b>A</b>), a zygote forms (<b>F</b>, given), the zygote is placed in culture medium (<b>D</b>), it develops into an embryo (<b>B</b>), and the embryo is placed in the uterus (<b>E</b>).",
