                "ms:c#2",
                "ms:c#3",
                "ms:c#4",
                "syllabus:18.3(4)"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "The marks are given for the order of each group and its position relative to F: <b>C G A</b> in order and above F, and <b>D B E</b> in order and below F.",
