          "reasoningChain": [
            "Start with what must happen in the female first: hormones (C), then harvesting oocytes (G).",
            "Fertilisation needs sperm added (A) before the zygote forms (F).",
            "The zygote is cultured (D), becomes an embryo (B), and the embryo is transferred to the uterus (E)."
